# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
.DS_Store

# Benchmark generated data & backups — regenerable via benchmarks/cmd_sonnet5/*.py,
# too large for git (raw per-sample dumps ~150 MB; disease corpus ~82 MB). The compact
# aggregates (AGGREGATE.md, aggregate.json, harmonize/*.csv, REPORT.md summaries) are
# committed instead.
benchmarks/cmd_sonnet5/out/
benchmarks/cmd_sonnet5/out_haiku/
benchmarks/cmd_sonnet5/out_ms/
benchmarks/cmd_sonnet5/out_ms.pre_fetchfix/
benchmarks/cmd_sonnet5/out*.pre_q2_*/
benchmarks/cmd_sonnet5/harmonize/disease_corpus_v041.csv
benchmarks/cmd_sonnet5/harmonize/*_cache/
*.log
.Rproj.user

# build artifacts / strays
*.html
result.csv
result.json
.DS_Store
.Rproj.user

# Retrieved article text archived per run (checksummed in ledger.jsonl; not redistributed)
benchmarks/cmd_sonnet5/out_v*/**/*.text.txt
!benchmarks/cmd_sonnet5/out_v*/**/*.log
# Frozen retrievals: paper text and parsed tables are not redistributed; fetched.json
# (provenance + checksums) is committed.
benchmarks/cmd_sonnet5/out_v*/_fetch/**/text.txt
benchmarks/cmd_sonnet5/out_v*/_fetch/**/tables.json

# Local reviewer notes (not part of the repository)
MANUSCRIPT_REVIEW.md
